#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:184
msgid "**Error: Kubernetes API not reachable**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:186
